# Duplicate into Dialogues/. Replace NPC_NAME and text inside <...>.
# Replace TEMPLATE_ACTIVITY_ID with an existing activity ID:
# fit_runner, garbage_quest, or boss_fight.
# This is a generic launcher; chapter rewards require their existing flow.

~ start
NPC_NAME: <Introduce the activity.>
NPC_NAME: <Explain the controls, goal, and failure condition briefly.>
- <Start the activity!>
	set SceneLoader.start_minigame("TEMPLATE_ACTIVITY_ID")
	=> END
- <Explain the rules again.>
	=> rules
- <I'll come back later.>
	=> END

~ rules
NPC_NAME: <Controls: what to press or hold.>
NPC_NAME: <Goal: what counts as success, including any time limit.>
NPC_NAME: <One useful tip.>
- <I'm ready!>
	set SceneLoader.start_minigame("TEMPLATE_ACTIVITY_ID")
	=> END
- <I'll prepare first.>
	=> END
